        "text": "=:warning: *{{ $json.file_name }}* was not posted to Instagram.\nIt is {{ $json.size_mb }} MB ({{ $json.mime_type || 'unknown type' }}). Reels need a video under {{ $json.max_mb }} MB here. Large files fail with HTTP 413 and \"Container Publication failed\".\nCompress it and drop it in again:\n`ffmpeg -i in.mp4 -c:v libx264 -crf 28 -preset slow -c:a aac -b:a 128k -movflags +faststart out.mp4`",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
